&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The unique location of the sunny hillsides of Volx allows us to grow a wide variety of fruit at the foot of the Alps. We carefully cultivate seasonal fruit, which we harvest by hand when ripe to ensure the best quality and flavour.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Preserves and Provisions</title><link>https://aubrihoun.fr/en/products/preserves/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aubrihoun.fr/en/products/preserves/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;As grower-producers, we are dedicated to bringing out the very best in our fruit. We take pride in crafting our own range of juices, fruit coulis, and jams. Each jar of jam and coulis is handmade by us.
We respect the natural flavour of the fruit by using only what is necessary in our recipes: fruit, sugar, pectin to set the jam, and citric acid to preserve the acidity of the fresh fruit. Fruit pectin allows us to achieve a good texture in our jam without overcooking it, thereby preserving all the flavours of the fresh fruit.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Olives</title><link>https://aubrihoun.fr/en/products/olives/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aubrihoun.fr/en/products/olives/</guid><description>&lt;div class="gallery-banner"&gt;





















 
