&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After spending the summer in the sun, the olives reach maturity in autumn and we harvest them from November to December.
We first harvest table olives, which are selected and picked by hand to preserve their flavours.
We then harvest the olives for tapenades and oils.
Our oils are produced using the first cold pressing: the olives are simply pressed, and the juice is then naturally decanted, revealing the pure, high-quality oil.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>